# Enterprise Code

This directory is part of the Kodus Enterprise Edition.

It is licensed under the Kodus Enterprise License (see `/license_ee.md` at the
repository root), **not** the AGPL-3.0 that covers the rest of the monorepo.

Files under `libs/ee/linked-repositories/` implement cross-repo context
(linked repositories) for code review. Production use requires a valid
Teams or Enterprise commercial agreement with Kodus.
